      <article  about="/departments-and-services/community-development/building/permit-and-plan-review-fees-building" class="node">

  
<div  class="page-header">
  
  <h1  class="page-header__title h1">
          <span>Permit and Plan Review Fees for the Building Department</span>

      </h1>
  </div>

  <div  class="basic-page">
    
    

      <div class="field-content">
                
  <h2  class="rich-text__h2 h2">
          

            <div class="field-heading">Notice</div>
      
      </h2>

  
<div  class="call-out-box">
  

            <div class="text-long"><p>Permit issuance after 4:30 p.m. will be on a limited basis.</p>
<p>No multiple permits will be issued after 4:30 p.m.</p>
<p>
  


  <a target="_blank" class="button button--secondary" href="/sites/default/files/2026-04/Exhibit%20A%20Mesa%20County%20Building%20Department%20Fee%20Schedule%202024%20ADA.pdf">
      

<span class="icon">
  <i class="fa-light fa-file-arrow-down" role="presentation" alt="file-arrow-down"></i>
</span>
    Adopted Fee Schedule (PDF)
</a>
</p>
</div>
      
</div>

              
  

<div  class="rich-text">
  <div  class="flexgrid-nm">
    <div  class="rich-text__body">
              

            <div class="text-long"><p><span class="button"><a data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="5d77a119-8f1a-4bea-ac3e-ddb7a2cd7183" href="/departments-and-services/community-development/building/permit-and-plan-review-fees-building-0" title="Building Permit Fee Estimator">Residential and Interior Remodel Permit Fee Calculator&nbsp;</a></span></p>
</div>
      
          </div>
  </div>
</div>
                
  <h2  class="rich-text__h2 h2">
          

            <div class="field-heading">New construction</div>
      
      </h2>

  

<div  class="rich-text">
  <div  class="flexgrid-nm">
    <div  class="rich-text__body">
              

            <div class="text-long"><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>To determine the applicable building permit fee for new construction, including additions, refer to the Building Department Fee Schedule</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>.&nbsp; Locate </span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><em><span>Table 3A- Building Valuation Data</span></em></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span> for the correct permit fee. Valuations will be rounded up in all cases.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<ol>
<li><span><span><span><span><span><span>Locate the use of the building from the left column.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
<li><span><span><span><span><span><span>Locate the construction type from one of the vertical columns. This will give you the per square foot construction costs.</span></span></span></span></span></span>
<ol>
<li><span><span><span><span><span><span>For residential one and two family construction and their related structures, use the VB (far right) column for square foot construction costs.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li><span><span><span><span><span><span>Determine the total valuation of the project by multiplying the area in square feet of the structure by the dollar amount indicated on the table.</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ol>
</div>
      
          </div>
  </div>
</div>
                
  <h2  class="rich-text__h2 h2">
          

            <div class="field-heading">Remodel work</div>
      
      </h2>

  

<div  class="rich-text">
  <div  class="flexgrid-nm">
    <div  class="rich-text__body">
              

            <div class="text-long"><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>Determine the applicable building permit fee for remodel work and all other building up-grades from <span>Mesa County Building Department Fee Schedule</span>, based on the valuation of the project.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
      
          </div>
  </div>
</div>
                
  <h2  class="rich-text__h2 h2">
          

            <div class="field-heading">Miscellaneous fees</div>
      
      </h2>

  

<div  class="rich-text">
  <div  class="flexgrid-nm">
    <div  class="rich-text__body">
              

            <div class="text-long"><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>Other fees may be assessed depending on the scope of the project.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
      
          </div>
  </div>
</div>
          </div>
  
  </div>

</article>

  </div>

  </div>

